ight":39},{"text":"처리기들은","x":700,"y":654,"width":171,"height":40},{"text":"독립적으로","x":883,"y":655,"width":175,"height":40},{"text":"자신의","x":1072,"y":655,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"작업을","x":1190,"y":655,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"처리한다.","x":1312,"y":655,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"전용","x":1478,"y":654,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"마이크로","x":1562,"y":653,"width":144,"height":40}]},{"text":"프로세서의 사용은 일반적인 형태이며 그렇다고 단일 처리기 시스템을 다중 처리기 시","words":[{"text":"프로세서의","x":325,"y":720,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"사용은","x":513,"y":720,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"일반적인","x":633,"y":720,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"형태이며","x":784,"y":721,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"그렇다고","x":937,"y":721,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"단일","x":1093,"y":721,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"처리기","x":1180,"y":721,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"시스템을","x":1301,"y":721,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"다중","x":1459,"y":721,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"처리기","x":1547,"y":720,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"시","x":1670,"y":720,"width":31,"height":39}]},{"text":"스템으로 변환하지는 않는다. 단일 처리 코어를 가진 범용 CPU가 하나만 있는 경우 시","words":[{"text":"스템으로","x":325,"y":786,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"변환하지는","x":478,"y":786,"width":169,"height":40},{"text":"않는다.","x":663,"y":786,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"단일","x":789,"y":786,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"처리","x":874,"y":787,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"코어를","x":955,"y":788,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"가진","x":1075,"y":787,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"범용","x":1159,"y":787,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"CPU가","x":1241,"y":787,"width":123,"height":40},{"text":"하나만","x":1377,"y":787,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"있는","x":1500,"y":787,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"경우","x":1585,"y":786,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"시","x":1670,"y":786,"width":31,"height":40}]},{"text":"스템은 단일 프로세서 시스템이다. 그러나 이 정의에 따르면, 현대 컴퓨터 시스템은 단일","words":[{"text":"스템은","x":325,"y":852,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"단일"